    """Best-of-candidates broadcast routing.

    Builds several candidate routings and picks the cheapest under the
    cost model where every distinct edge used is paid once per partition:
      1. Independent per-destination shortest paths (direct cheap routes).
      2. Approximate Steiner tree (multi-source Dijkstra heuristic) that
         maximizes edge sharing to eliminate redundant transfers.
      3. Steiner tree with a different attach order for tree diversity.
